usage: plan.py add-artifact [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] --path PATH --role
                            {input,output} [--id ID]
                            plan item

declare an input or output artifact of an item; a repeat is a no-op

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  item

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --path PATH           repository path or @plan/ path
  --role {input,output}
  --id ID               artifact id, addressed as artifact/<id> (an output
                        declares it, an input cites it)
